The zedBSD i915 GPU driver (src/drivers/gpu/i915/) contains code derived from
the Linux kernel v6.8.12 i915 and DRM display drivers (drivers/gpu/drm/i915/,
drivers/gpu/drm/display/, drivers/gpu/drm/drm_edid.c and their headers), which
carry the MIT notice below.  The rest of the driver is zedBSD's own code under
the zlib license (/usr/share/licenses/zedbsd/LICENSE).

